%%{init: {'theme':'neutral'}}%%
flowchart TB
    ST[S_t at this tick] --> CL{Classify<br/>against thresholds}
    CL -->|S_t < MILD<br/>calm| CMD_INC[Candidate command: INCREASE]
    CL -->|MILD <= S_t < HIGH<br/>stressed| HOLD[No command sent<br/>scene holds]
    CL -->|S_t >= HIGH<br/>ultra_stressed| CMD_DEC[Candidate command: DECREASE]

    CMD_INC --> GATE{Wait-for-calm<br/>gate open?}
    CMD_DEC --> GATE

    GATE -->|no| DROP1[Drop and count as gated]
    GATE -->|yes| THROT{Throttle window<br/>elapsed?<br/>at least 1 s since last}

    THROT -->|no| DROP2[Drop and count as throttled]
    THROT -->|yes| SEND[Send UDP packet<br/>to Unity on port 5005]

    SEND --> AUDIT[Append row to<br/>unity_udp.csv]
    SEND --> RESET[Reset throttle window]

    classDef decision fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px
    classDef action   fill:#e8f8ea,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px
    classDef drop     fill:#f8e8e8,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px
    classDef send     fill:#e8f4f8,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px

    class CL,GATE,THROT decision
    class CMD_INC,CMD_DEC,HOLD,AUDIT,RESET action
    class DROP1,DROP2 drop
    class SEND send
